-- Phase 5: apply the external AI review (OpenAI GPT-6 via Codex, 2026-09-26) to the three
-- live free recipes. Two were rejected for choking risks (whole peas, whole blueberries).
-- Also: times that include cooling, a salmon temperature, a named oil and flour, safer
-- storage, and summaries without unsupported nutrition claims.
-- allergen_review_state stays 'unknown': an AI check is not a human review.
